{#- THAUMA'S OWN FORMS (Chase, 2026-09-27: "staff is only for staff
   functions and admin is for admin"). They were Sharing's "Thauma" side.

   WHAT HAPPENS TO WHAT A VISITOR SENDS, AND NOTHING ELSE. thauma.one's forms
   are part of its pages, hand-built on the API rather than the embed, so
   every word on them is a site word, edited in Pages like the rest of the
   page and published with it. What lives here is what no page says: where a
   message goes, who it is sent as, the reasons a visitor picks from, and
   which lists the sign-up form offers. Each form links to where its words
   are. These save and apply at once; they are not part of the site's files,
   so they do not wait for Publish (whose bar steps aside while this one
   shows). -#}
<div class="wf" id="wfRoot">
  <div class="ml-whose-opts wf-pick" role="tablist" aria-label="Forms">
    <button type="button" class="ml-whose-opt is-on" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-wf="contact"
            data-i18n="sh.item.contact">Contact form</button>
    <button type="button" class="ml-whose-opt" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-wf="signup"
            data-i18n="sh.item.signup">Sign-up form</button>
  </div>

  <p class="rolegate" id="wfProblem" hidden></p>

  <section class="sh-card wf-panel" data-wf-panel="contact">
    <button type="button" class="switch" id="wfCtOpen" role="switch" aria-checked="false">
      <span class="switch-track"><span class="switch-state" data-i18n="switch.off">Off</span><span class="switch-knob"></span></span>
      <span class="switch-label"><span data-i18n="sh.live">Live</span></span>
    </button>
    <div class="wf-grid">
      <label class="fld"><span data-i18n="ml.ctTo">Send messages to</span>
        <input type="email" id="wfCtTo" maxlength="200" placeholder="you@example.org"></label>
      <label class="fld"><span data-i18n="ml.ctFrom">Sent from</span>
        <select id="wfCtFrom"></select></label>
    </div>
    <div class="ct-topics">
      <span class="sh-lbl" data-i18n="ml.ctTopics">What is this about</span>
      {#- The reasons in every language the site publishes (0041), one
         language at a time with another beside it, like Pages. -#}
      <div class="ms-writing wf-writing" id="wfWritingRow" hidden>
        <label class="ms-pick"><span data-i18n="con.editing">Editing</span>
          <select id="wfWriting" class="lang-pick" data-lang-edit></select></label>
        <span class="lang-ref" id="wfBesideWrap">
          <button type="button" class="lang-swap" data-lang-swap data-i18n-attr="aria-label:con.swap,title:con.swap" aria-label="Swap" title="Swap">&#8644;</button>
          <label class="ms-pick"><span data-i18n="con.reference">Reference</span>
            <select id="wfBeside" class="lang-pick" data-lang-ref></select></label>
          <button type="button" class="ghost-btn sm lang-ai" data-lang-translate data-i18n="ai.translate">Translate</button>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div id="wfTopics"></div>
      <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="wfAddTopic" data-i18n="ml.ctAddTopic">Add a reason</button>
    </div>
    <a class="up-share-link" href="/admin/website/" data-web-go="pages" data-pages-section="contact"
       data-i18n="wf.wordsContact">Its words → Pages › Contact</a>
  </section>

  <section class="sh-card wf-panel" data-wf-panel="signup" hidden>
    <span class="sh-lbl" data-i18n="sh.lists">Lists on this form</span>
    <div class="sh-switches" id="wfLists"></div>
    <a class="up-share-link" href="/admin/website/mail/" data-web-go="mail"
       data-i18n="wf.toMail">Thauma's lists → Mail</a>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="ms-savebar" id="wfBar" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden>
  <span class="ms-dirty-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span id="wfCount"></span>
  <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="wfDiscard" data-i18n="ms.discard">Discard</button>
  <button type="button" class="solid-btn" id="wfSave" data-i18n="sh.save">Save changes</button>
</div>
